&lt;p&gt;From: Lhennay, To: Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Pearl, Illinois on July 6, 1911&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
503 N. School St.&lt;br&gt;
Normal, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Friend Ruby,&lt;br&gt;
Of course the feat is not accomplishable, yet the endeavor is always worth the time spent. Had a splendid time on the 4th. You will hear the particulars later. Hope to hear from you soon.&lt;br&gt;
Lhennay&lt;/p&gt;</description>
